<title>
Oil Temperature Sensor Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1316012">Oil Temperature Sensor Removal and Installation:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Do not measure resistance with terminal of the oil temperature sensor soaked in water.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
As for the measurement in the soaked state, an accurate measurement cannot be done.
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<ptxt>
Check resistance between terminal “1” and terminal “2” varies depending on water temperature as shown in the following graph.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If faulty condition is found, replace oil temperature sensor (1). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1316012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
